WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.386
INAS App connects field conditions, team work, and irrigation in one place.

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:09.495
See crop targets beside current readings, so today's conditions are clear at a glance.

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:14.396
Measurements become prioritized work suggestions, with a reason for each decision.

00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:19.707
Every task moves through planned, in progress, awaiting review, and completed.

00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:24.561
For each member, managers can see approved completions and submissions awaiting review.

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:30.598
Workers submit their record and managers verify it. Only approved work counts as complete.

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:35.428
Daily work and harvest windows stay visible across the full growing season.

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:40.642
Irrigation appears as the next scheduled event, not an instant command.

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:45.230
The controller saves power by sleeping, then receives Hub settings when it wakes.

00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:50.296
Set irrigation as a schedule for a future wake cycle, preserving low-power operation.

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:54.832
See it, assign it, verify it. Run the field with INAS App.
